        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6B7A', marginTop: 10 }}>· 主循环、帧率与事件驱动</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: '1280px', height: '720px' }}>
        <svg width='1280' height='720' viewBox='0 0 1280 720'>
            <rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.4 帧率：为什么你的游戏在别人电脑上会「加速」</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· while True 有个隐藏问题：它转多快，完全由电脑的 CPU 和显卡决定。</text><text x='82' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· tick(60) 的意思是：这一圈的活儿 5 毫秒就干完了，就主动睡大约 11.67 毫秒…</text><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='686' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.5 事件驱动：游戏像一个前台接待</text><text x='686' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· pygame.event.get() 取的是「积压的所有事件」，不是「刚刚发生的那一个」…</text><text x='686' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 每张表有类型：event.type。最常用的几种：</text><text x='686' y='226.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 同一次按键，还带细节：event.key 告诉你具体是哪个键…</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
